  "description": "Borgman Earls are delighted to present this bright and spacious two double-bedroom ground-floor apartment to the Dublin Rental Market. Located in one of Dublin 18's most desirable residential developments. \n\n**AVAILABLE FROM THE 16TH OF OCTOBER 2026** \n\nThe property is within a minute's walk of the Green Luas Station (The Gallops), and is within easy access to the M50 & N11; Dublin Airport, Sandyford Industrial Estate, Dundrum Town Centre, and Stepaside Village. The property also benefits from use of a large parkland area for all residents of Kilgobbin Wood. \n\nAccommodation in brief comprises: entrance hallway with wooden flooring and large storage press. There is a spacious open-plan living and dining area with feature fireplace and doors leading to a balcony. The semi-open plan kitchen is fitted with modern units and includes a full range of modern appliances including gas hob, electric oven, washing machine, fridge/freezer, dishwasher & microwave. There are two generously sized double bedrooms with built-in storage. The master bedroom is en suite. Main bathroom including bath & shower. \n\nThe apartment includes 1 designated parking space & there are ample visitor spaces in the development. \n\nThe tenancy will be professionally managed by Borgman Earls Property Consultants. \n\nContact us now to confirm your private viewing time.",
